\pard\b\fs20 Elysium Abyss\b0\par
\fs16\par
Research team Delta is sitting in the lander. The hatches are sealed, the lander has undocked. At this moment another team radios them that an inactive volcano very close to their landing site has suddenly erupted. A gigantic, deep rift has opened up in their zone. Ash and lava darken the sun on the surface...\par
But it's too late, there is no turning back... The Clonks now have to make the best of the situation. Exploring the newly formed chasm is strongly discouraged: all probes sent there immediately lost contact with the base...\par
